    "summary": "ARNOLD已追到NPZ重建、兩階段策略、具體joint／pickup／orientation／water checker及score聚合。水量實作是cup world-AABB內粒子比例，成功還需連續穩定；normalized訓練state不可直接當checker原生target。checkpoint選擇有list.argmax靜態錯誤，且GT輔助結果必須獨立保存。",
    "identity_note": "固定論文為Gong、Huang等人的ARNOLD: A Benchmark for Language-Grounded Task Learning With Continuous States in Realistic 3D Scenes，arXiv:2304.04321v2（2023-09-11）。PDF第7頁直接指arnold-benchmark/arnold，README作者、題名與arXiv相符。此repo含benchmark與改寫的PerAct/6D-CLIPort基線；它們是P077/P078方法的重用，不是原倉庫資料或同一評測協定。",
    "discovery_evidence": [
